# Experimental draft hub court

When the user says **revert** (locker/cards/court experiment context), restore the classic Goal $1B hub five-position rows.

## How to revert

1. In `components/tradeup/BillionTradeEngine.tsx`, set `EXPERIMENTAL_DRAFT_HUB_CARDS = false`.
2. That restores the previous `classic-lineup-board` UI (still behind the flag).
3. Optionally remove `components/tradeup/DraftHubCards.tsx` and `.draft-hub-court*` CSS if cleaning up.

Do **not** commit/push/deploy unless asked.
